    "body": "I fixed up all the commits from https://github.com/TokTok/toxic/pull/273 into a single commit, and simplified things a bit. Also using fork and execlp instead of popen now.\r\n\r\nLooks better, @nurupo, @Green-Sky, @JFreegman ?\r\n\r\nAlso tested it and it actually works 🥳\n\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\n- - -\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/toxic/407)\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\n",
    "changed_files": 4,
    "closed_at": null,
    "comment_data": [
